                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i data-lucide="calendar" class="w-4 h-4"></i> Sep 15, 2023</span>
                        <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i data-lucide="clock" class="w-4 h-4"></i> 6 min read</span>
                    </div>
